# negative_out.claim — THE CLAIM, OUT OF THE RULE.
#
# A callee that answers with an AUTHORITATIVE NEGATIVE through an out-parameter
# (or a defaulted trailing parameter) which a caller may silently decline to
# read. Column 2 is that parameter's 0-BASED POSITION in the parameter list.
#
# An entry here is a claim with an author. Derived by reading the declarations
